  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, combine the soy sauce, pork strips and half the garlic stir-fry sauce. Set aside.\n• Trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks.\n• Shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).\n• Slice lime into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise, the remaining garlic stir-fry sauce and a squeeze of lime juice. Set aside. ~~~~~~~~~~ MODULAR STEP ~~~~~~~~~~ Trim and roughly chop pea pods.\n• Thinly slice cucumber into sticks.\n• Shred baby cos lettuce (see ingredients).\n• Slice lime into wedges.\n• In a small bowl, combine mayonnaise, half the garlic stir-fry sauce and a squeeze of lime juice. Set aside.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c5268df4b525c8eb5da914-8a104d19.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add the remaining garlic stir-fry sauce and the soy sauce and stir to combine, 1 minute. TIP: If your pan is getting crowded, cook pork in batches for the best results!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c5268df4b525c8eb5da914-70f7fcff.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts, until warmed through.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c5268df4b525c8eb5da914-ae0080aa.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Spread each tortilla with some garlic mayo and top with the cos lettuce, pea pods, cucumber and plant-based mince.\n• Tear over parsley.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots and serve with lime wedges. Enjoy! Little cooks: Take the lead and help build the tacos!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-67c5268df4b525c8eb5da914-06b0fc9b.jpeg"
    }
  ]
